{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119901","id":3774535564,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7g-teM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119901","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119901.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119901.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119901","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119901/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119901/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119901/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f9f8b06c52471982492bf94524720d06898cac2","number":119901,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix flickering on resize caused by auto-exposure","user":{"login":"almic","id":21991767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTkxNzY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21991767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic","html_url":"https://github.com/almic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Cache current luminance value before freeing buffer and use that as the initial clear color when re-configuring\r\n- Stops bright flashing when resizing in the editor and in game\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #104761\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI'm not certain about the method of obtaining the current value from the buffer, if there is a better way let me know. I'm not a fan of including `marshalls.h` for what is effectively a reinterpret cast of 4 bytes, but I suppose it's better to use official APIs instead of hacking in a direct cast.\r\n\r\nThe default clear for current is equivalent to the GRAY color. Using a default color other than black is better anyway because that is the main cause of over-exposure during resizing. If something happens and it loses the current value, it will still flick to a new exposure but the brighter default will prevent it from blinding people for a second.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use